    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, horizontal vs vertical dependency? i haven't heard those terms used in class before. i thought the main thing was just transitive dependencies. can you explain that horizontal thing again? i'm confused about how to spot one in a real table.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
